{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02","cat":"bond","group":{"id":"char5136","label":"Crust"},"label":"The Role of Cooking Oil","stage":null,"prev":"d_nikke_crust_01","next":"d_nikke_crust_03","speakers":{"crust":"Crust","bready":"Bready"},"icons":{"crust":"si_c521_00_s","bready":"si_c520_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_1","text":"Mr. Gourmand, do you know what our official duties are as Cooking Oil?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Kitchen","bgArt":"kitchen","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_overjoy","movie":null,"shown":["crust"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_2","text":"Most people probably think that","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_3","text":"one of us cooks, the other tastes, and that's all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_4","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_4","text":"... Is that not what you do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_5","text":"No, it is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_6","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_7","text":"But there's more to it than that!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_8","text":"We collect edible ingredients from the surface and conduct analytical research.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_9","text":"Bready can ascertain the ingredients and other information just by tasting something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_10","text":"One short taste is all she needs, and she can do it without wasting any valuable ingredients.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_11","text":"I then use that gathered data and experiment with Splendamin in an attempt to reproduce the various flavors that we come across.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_12","text":"Your job is much more important than I thought it was.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_13","text":"Hehe, I'm glad you think it's important work.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_14","text":"We're allotted a certain timeframe in which we can conduct our culinary research, and if, after submitting our final report, we're granted permission,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_15","text":"we introduce some of the recipes on the Crunchy Cooking Class, hehe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_16","text":"But don't we have already more than enough food that we can make from Splendamin?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_17","text":"It's hard to imagine there's all that much more we could make from it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_18","text":"That may seem true,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_19","text":"but there are still plenty of ingredients, cooking methods, and dishes out there that we don't know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_20","text":"We aren't sure at what point we'll cease living in the Ark,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_21","text":"so the endeavor of reproducing unfamiliar foods and flavors from up on the surface","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_22","text":"is sure to enrich people's lives in the future!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_23","text":"I see!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_24","text":"So, Bready and I will be heading to the surface tomorrow.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_25","text":"Would you be interested in coming together with us, Mr. Gourmand?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_26","text":"Up to the surface? Were you and Bready originally planning on going up alone?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_27","text":"Yep!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_28","text":"Having said that, there are certain risks that are involved in the whole procedure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_29","text":"For example, there's the risk of Bready's abilities being exposed to the public.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_30","text":"Then there's the possibility of someone sneaking in research ingredients from the surface and exposing all of our trade secrets!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_31","text":"Then are you sure it's okay for me to tag along?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_32","text":"Of course!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_33","text":"I trust you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_34","text":"I appreciate you saying that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_35","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_35","text":"It's always a good feeling when someone places their trust in you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_36","text":"I'll send you the location of the elevator.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_37","text":"We can meet there tomorrow.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_38","text":"Okay, see you then.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_39","text":"Bonne Bouche!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"ElevatorOut","bgArt":"elevatorout","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_apricot","movie":null,"shown":["bready"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_40","text":"Are you coming as my personal snack?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_41","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_41","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_42","text":"Bready, I get that you enjoy his flavor, but that's a bit degrading to call Mr. Gourmand that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_43","text":"Besides, you should be plenty satisfied with all the lunch boxes I've prepared for you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_44","text":"Mr. Gourmand is coming along to lend a helping hand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_45","text":"That's too bad... *drool*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_46","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_47","text":"All right then, let's head out!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_48","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_48","text":"*Beep beep*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Elevator","bgArt":"elevator","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_49","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_49","text":"*Clunk*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_50","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_50","text":"What pathway does this elevator take?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_51","text":"It connects to Cooking Oil's hideout.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_52","text":"You have a hideout on the surface?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_53","text":"Hehe, that's just the way we refer to it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_54","text":"After visiting several different locations, we determined this place had the most optimal environment for obtaining ingredients.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_55","text":"So we installed an elevator and made it so that only certain people are allowed to use it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_56","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_56","text":"Very thorough.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_57","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_57","text":"Are all these measures for secrecy really necessary?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_58","text":"It absolutely is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_59","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_60","text":"You'll understand when we get to the surface and see for yourself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_61","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_61","text":"*Clunk*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Grassland","bgArt":"grassland","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_62","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_62","text":"The moment we arrive on the surface,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_secretgarden","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_63","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_63","text":"I instantaneously understand what Bready meant.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_64","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_64","text":"In front of me is a verdant, grassy meadow filled with all different types of flowers and fruit trees.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_65","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_65","text":"Oh my gosh...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_66","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_66","text":"Have you been farming out here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_67","text":"No.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_68","text":"Unfortunately, we don't have that kind of time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_69","text":"Initially, the land here was fertile and brimming with all manner of fruits and crops.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_70","text":"We figured that since this place had managed to grow this much without the help of humans,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_71","text":"we would simply try and protect it and not overtly intervene in the ecosystem.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"crust","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_72","text":"The members of Botanic Garden really helped a lot, hehe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crust_02_73","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crust_02_73","text":"This is the first time I've seen the surface look so peaceful.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"